<!-- ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">Common questions</span>
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          What does the 7-day re-clean guarantee actually cover?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>If your property manager or agent raises any cleaning-related issues at your vacate inspection — or within 7 calendar days of that inspection — we'll return and remedy those specific areas at no additional charge. The only condition is that you notify us within that 7-day window and provide us the agent's written feedback (email, text, or condition report copy).</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          How far in advance do I need to book?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>We accept bookings with as little as 48 hours' notice, subject to availability. We recommend booking as soon as you know your vacate date — slots during month-end periods (especially 28th–1st) fill up fast. Use the quote wizard above to check availability for your preferred date.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          Do I need to be home during the clean?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>Not at all. Most customers drop off keys beforehand or arrange access through their agent. We'll send you real-time photo updates throughout the clean so you can see progress from wherever you are. We'll lock up and return keys when we're done.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          Is carpet steam cleaning included in the base price?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>Carpet steam clean is an optional add-on (strongly recommended — it's the most common bond deduction). It's pre-selected in our quote wizard so you don't forget, but you can uncheck it if your property has no carpet or you've arranged it separately. See the pricing table above for per-bedroom carpet steam pricing.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          Can I pay with Afterpay?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>Yes — we accept Afterpay, allowing you to split the cost into 4 interest-free fortnightly payments. This is particularly useful when your bond is still held and you need to pay for the clean out of pocket. Select Afterpay when confirming your booking.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          What if the property is in really bad condition?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>Our fixed prices cover standard end-of-lease condition — normal use over a tenancy. For properties with heavy grease buildup, mould, pet odours, or excessive damage, we may need to discuss a supplementary fee. We'll always flag this when you call or message to confirm the booking, never on the day.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)" aria-expanded="false">
          Do you provide a receipt / invoice for my records?
          <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" role="region">
          <div class="faq-inner"><p>Yes. You'll receive a detailed tax invoice and the photo report via email within 2 hours of the clean completing. Hang onto both — agents and VCAT occasionally request them as evidence during bond disputes.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

